      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1n9rlz1'
    '|b||How much they matter for life''s big, rare choices: contested.':
