      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:ojwmvs'
    '|b||In 2001 Kahneman and Ralph Hertwig, a Gigerenzer co-author, even ran a joint Linda study to settle it. They finished still disagreeing about what it meant.':
